{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 136, "line_no": 36, "text": "拜，是广义的祖先概念。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 2358, "w": 418, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "拜，是广义的祖先概念。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 2358, "w": 418, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 136, "line_no": 37, "text": "布依语中祖宗的概念 pau泛指列祖列宗，表示男性。以pau’泛称祖宗，是男权社会", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 2414, "w": 1460, "h": 66}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依语中祖宗的概念 pau泛指列祖列宗，表示男性。以pau’泛称祖宗，是男权社会", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 2414, "w": 1460, "h": 66}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
